<title>CANADA: Arakis says lawsuit dismissed in U.S.</title>
<headline>Arakis says lawsuit dismissed in U.S.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arakis Energy Corp said on Friday that a U.S. district judge dismissed a class action lawsuit against the company by Arakis shareholders.</p>
<p>Arakis said the plaintiffs had 45 days to file an amended complaint.</p>
<p>Arakis spokesman David Harrison said 22 suits had been filed against the company by shareholders, which were combined into a single class action law suit.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
